{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11103050","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11103050","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1110305001:1":{"text":"お前は見事に自分の実力を証明した。ソーン、ブラックロアーはお前を再び受け入れるぞ。","source_cn":"索恩，现在你已经证明了自己的实力。黑嚎氏族愿意重新接纳你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x495016D51BCFCC61","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1110305002:2":{"text":"ああ、戻ってこい、ソーン！俺たちは同じ血脈を持つ仲間だ。これ以上弱小者たちとつるむ必要はない。","source_cn":"是啊，快回来吧！与你血脉同源的族人是我们，别跟这些弱者...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9F018CEF88C4C25","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110305003:1":{"text":"赤子のオレに「弱小」の烙印を押しつけ、身一つで砂漠に放り出したのは――","source_cn":"出生后，把我打上“弱小”烙印的，剥去我的襁褓，将我遗弃...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x545CEF7717FBE4E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1110305004:1":{"text":"「同じ血脈を持つ仲間」じゃなかったのか？","source_cn":"“血脉同源的族人”吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A4630A2DB8BDDEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1110305005:1":{"text":"砂漠の夜は水すら凍る。そんな場所に赤子を置き去りにするなんて、<style=\"stress\">生かす</style>ためか<style=\"stress\">殺す</style>ためかなんて、明白だよな？","source_cn":"沙漠的黑夜滴水成冰。你们把一个婴儿遗弃在那里，是想让他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD69A362B2AA1FEE4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1110305006:1":{"text":"父ちゃんに拾われた時から、オレはウール族のソーンだ。","source_cn":"从老爹收留我的那一刻起，我就只是乌尔氏族的索恩了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD00FD40F3DE7D0D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1110305007:1":{"text":"なら、ブラックロアーはお前にとってのなんだ？","source_cn":"那你又把我们黑嚎氏族当成了什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x235948413AAB447A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1110305008:1":{"text":"敵、とでも言うと思ったか？なんとも思ってない、ただの赤の他人だ。","source_cn":"仇人？你们还不配。你们只是陌生人而已。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x404C4F914EF40AB8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1110305009:1":{"text":"聞き分けの悪いガキが！もういい、お前をぶっ飛ばしてでも連れて帰るからな！","source_cn":"不识好歹的东西！咱们今天抢也要把你小子抢回去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E9D17CF29DCAA96","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1110305010:1":{"text":"落ち着いて、ソーン！僕も君と同じぐらい頭にきてるけど、まずは冷静にならないと……","source_cn":"冷静一点，索恩！我和你一样气愤，但我们得先想办法……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15F75ABA6843DDA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1110305011:1":{"text":"アルサ……お前にオレの怒りは分からない。","source_cn":"阿尔萨……你永远不可能和我一样气愤。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E5A68ED74392C27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1110305012:1":{"text":"はいはい、分かったから！とにかく、君は絶対に奪わせないよ！","source_cn":"好了好了，我知道！我绝对不会让他们把你抢走的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85F34053CF079E0C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1110305013:1":{"text":"雑魚どもがいっちょ前にソーンを守るだ？守ってもらう方の間違いだろう？","source_cn":"一群乌合之众，还想保护索恩？他们反过来还要你保护，对吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x765451DCDCB656DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1110305014:1":{"text":"黙れ。","source_cn":"闭嘴。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C61C6EDC8A2262E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:骄傲的黑嚎战士":{"text":"高慢なブラックロアー","source":"骄傲的黑嚎战士","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:强壮的黑嚎战士":{"text":"屈強なブラックロアー","source":"强壮的黑嚎战士","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:索恩":{"text":"ソーン","source":"索恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阿尔萨":{"text":"アルサ","source":"阿尔萨","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":15,"localized_text_count":14,"speaker_count":4}}